# If the permanent Iroh's combat ability targets becomes an illegal target by the time it resolves, the ability does nothing
# and the "you may" is not offered (ruling). Bot1 targets Iroh himself at the beginning of combat; Bot2 destroys Iroh with
# Infernal Grasp in response (Bot2 loses 2). Nothing is given away, Bot1 is never asked (`! Bot1.Accept`) and no Ally appears.
# The Food token from Iroh's enters trigger stays with Bot1.

